SN MemReport v1.0

A very small memory report for online usage.  Useful for yourself, mainly.

Quick & Easy Installation:

 1  Place it somewhere.  (PFiles: would be good.)

 2  Add "MEM |{#0<path>SN_MemReport}" to your bbsmenu under either
    "1; Maintenance" or "2;Available everywhere"  Modify your online
    menu(s)) to reflect the new addition if you want users to be able
    to use it.  Note that the above { is actually a control-Q command.

 3  Reload your bbstext/bbsmenu via CNet's Control Panel menu (option
    #3, "Text/menu reload  RAmiga-T" and you're all set!

(This sucker wasn't big enough to deserve it's own .guide, installer, icons,
help file, blah blah blah plus tax...)

